#: ../../index.rst:2
msgid "FreePlot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid "FreePlot 是一个基于 Matplotlib 的 Python 绘图库, 面向论文和实验图表场景, 提供更直接的图形容器、样式配置和常见绘图封装。"
msgstr "FreePlot is a Python plotting library built on top of Matplotlib. It targets paper figures and experiment reports, with a direct figure container, reusable style configuration, and wrappers for common chart types."

#: ../../index.rst:7
msgid "核心特性"
msgstr "Features"

#: ../../index.rst:9
msgid "基于 Matplotlib, 保留底层 Axes 的可控性。"
msgstr "Built on Matplotlib while keeping direct access to the underlying axes."

#: ../../index.rst:10
msgid "提供网格化图形容器, 支持按位置或标题访问子图。"
msgstr "Provides a grid-based figure container with position and title based access."

#: ../../index.rst:11
msgid "封装折线图、散点图、柱状图、热力图、雷达图、小提琴图和 3D 曲面图等常见图表。"
msgstr "Wraps common charts, including line, scatter, bar, heatmap, radar, violin, and 3D surface plots."

#: ../../index.rst:12
msgid "面向无 GUI 环境的保存式示例, 便于测试和文档构建。"
msgstr "Keeps examples save-oriented, so they work in headless environments and documentation builds."

